    fresh, made at the difficulty the forge walks at, with no class until the class page names one. Its id is the
    forge's to mint (forgeWalk), once for the whole forge. */
export function freshSeatSheet(difficulty) {
    return makeEntity({ abilities: { difficulty }, classes: { path: null } });
}

/** A SEAT'S HOUSE IN HER PAGE'S WORDS (step 1's move 24e, sadia's row 9): "own" for a house the seat named (the house
    it was raised in, its name and banner beside it), "none" for none (steps/lineage.js's keys). The house page wrote
    a true or false here, so one field of the who section held two shapes. */
