       a thing set down or a raindrop. A BODY'S FEET ask this instead: the highest surface at or below where they
       stand plus the step they may take up (world/terrain.js surfaceBelow), so a plank at knee height is stepped
       onto, a deck overhead is walked under, and a body leaving planks for ground far below falls. The terrain
       itself rides exactly as before: a slope is never a fall. STEP_UP is a stair and a half; STEP_DOWN is how far
